{"3394690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Steel Judgment", "steam_appid": 3394690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>GAME-BREAKING ROGUELIKE CHAOS MEETS STYLISH MOVEMENT SHOOTER ACTION.</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/66e9980a83de5dca1c1965c95e81a29d.poster.avif?t=1785509595\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/66e9980a83de5dca1c1965c95e81a29d.webm?t=1785509595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/66e9980a83de5dca1c1965c95e81a29d.mp4?t=1785509595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNHINGED ROGUELIKE CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Steel Judgment, every item has a unique effect that stacks and combines with others. Become the ultimate killing machine. <i>Break the game. I dare you</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/10e6fc2c668d1f0e578467ab8d447404.poster.avif?t=1785509595\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/10e6fc2c668d1f0e578467ab8d447404.webm?t=1785509595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/10e6fc2c668d1f0e578467ab8d447404.mp4?t=1785509595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STYLISH MOVEMENT SHOOTER + SPECTACLE FIGHTER COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal isn't to just defeat your enemies; it's to wipe them out in ridiculously fancy ways. Bounce off enemies, uppercut and air-dash your way through danger. Uncover movement tech and find creative ways to outmaneuver foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/d592cbf61b77cd4387beb30e872c49e0.poster.avif?t=1785509595\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/d592cbf61b77cd4387beb30e872c49e0.webm?t=1785509595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/d592cbf61b77cd4387beb30e872c49e0.mp4?t=1785509595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER YOUR ARSENAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover powerful weapons with deep mechanics and synergies. Play around with different combinations of weapons and upgrade items to craft your own strategies and builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/51282a3e74a114e5df46566a05b46ec0.poster.avif?t=1785509595\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/51282a3e74a114e5df46566a05b46ec0.webm?t=1785509595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/51282a3e74a114e5df46566a05b46ec0.mp4?t=1785509595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TAKE THEIR SOULS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy has a unique ability that you can copy. Steal souls and perform even nastier combos on foes using their own attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/0b63e79147f0725dd3e9b160d45579e9.poster.avif?t=1785509595\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/0b63e79147f0725dd3e9b160d45579e9.webm?t=1785509595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/0b63e79147f0725dd3e9b160d45579e9.mp4?t=1785509595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME THE BEST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through various realms and conquer challenging bosses. Looking for a challenge? Compete to be the best on the leaderboards with added difficulty modifiers once you've cleared a normal run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>They are ferocious, their thirst for conquest, insatiable... But they will know fear when you rain our vengeance down on them. Those who seek to desecrate and infest Asphodel shall all face Steel Judgment!</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>GAME-BREAKING ROGUELIKE CHAOS MEETS STYLISH MOVEMENT SHOOTER ACTION.</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/66e9980a83de5dca1c1965c95e81a29d.poster.avif?t=1785509595\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/66e9980a83de5dca1c1965c95e81a29d.webm?t=1785509595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/66e9980a83de5dca1c1965c95e81a29d.mp4?t=1785509595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNHINGED ROGUELIKE CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Steel Judgment, every item has a unique effect that stacks and combines with others. Become the ultimate killing machine. <i>Break the game. I dare you</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/10e6fc2c668d1f0e578467ab8d447404.poster.avif?t=1785509595\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/10e6fc2c668d1f0e578467ab8d447404.webm?t=1785509595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/10e6fc2c668d1f0e578467ab8d447404.mp4?t=1785509595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STYLISH MOVEMENT SHOOTER + SPECTACLE FIGHTER COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal isn't to just defeat your enemies; it's to wipe them out in ridiculously fancy ways. Bounce off enemies, uppercut and air-dash your way through danger. Uncover movement tech and find creative ways to outmaneuver foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/d592cbf61b77cd4387beb30e872c49e0.poster.avif?t=1785509595\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/d592cbf61b77cd4387beb30e872c49e0.webm?t=1785509595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/d592cbf61b77cd4387beb30e872c49e0.mp4?t=1785509595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER YOUR ARSENAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover powerful weapons with deep mechanics and synergies. Play around with different combinations of weapons and upgrade items to craft your own strategies and builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/51282a3e74a114e5df46566a05b46ec0.poster.avif?t=1785509595\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/51282a3e74a114e5df46566a05b46ec0.webm?t=1785509595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/51282a3e74a114e5df46566a05b46ec0.mp4?t=1785509595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TAKE THEIR SOULS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy has a unique ability that you can copy. Steal souls and perform even nastier combos on foes using their own attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/0b63e79147f0725dd3e9b160d45579e9.poster.avif?t=1785509595\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/0b63e79147f0725dd3e9b160d45579e9.webm?t=1785509595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/0b63e79147f0725dd3e9b160d45579e9.mp4?t=1785509595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME THE BEST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragr